<section class="page-shell"><div class="page-header"><span class="eyebrow">Companion Mode™</span><h1>Support without taking over.</h1><p>You only see the care elements each person has explicitly shared with you.</p></div><div class="caregiver-grid"><% cards.forEach(card=>{ %><article class="card"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Shared with you</span><h2><%= card.client.name %></h2></div><span class="status"><%= card.client.therapeuticMode %></span></div><% if(card.summary){ %><h3>Care summary</h3><pre><%= card.summary.summary %></pre><% } %><% if(card.milestones.length){ %><h3>Shared milestones</h3><ul><% card.milestones.forEach(m=>{ %><li><strong><%= m.title %></strong> — <%= m.note %></li><% }) %></ul><% } %><% if(card.plan){ %><h3>Care plan</h3><ul><% (card.plan.nextActions||[]).forEach(x=>{ %><li><%= x %></li><% }) %></ul><% } %><div class="ethical-note"><strong>Companion boundary.</strong> Listen, ask permission, and keep your own capacity in view. This dashboard does not make you a clinician.</div></article><% }) %><% if(!cards.length){ %><div class="card empty-state"><h2>No active companion links.</h2><p>A Chiedza user can invite this caregiver account from their consent settings.</p></div><% } %></div></section>
